Description: Eclipse-based IDE for Event-B
 The Rodin platform is an Eclipse-based integrated development environment for
 Event-B. It supports refinement, mathematical proof, type-checking and the
 generation and discharge of proof obligations, and is extensible through a wide
 range of plug-ins.
 .
 This package ships the eventb-rossi Rodin Bundle: Rodin 3.10 with parallel
 automatic proving, the SMT solvers, the ProB animator and disprover, the Proof
 Obligation Cleaner and the Rossi bridge for the Rossi language server. It
 repackages the upstream Eclipse RCP distribution and needs a Java 21 or newer
 runtime; webkit2gtk is recommended for the browser-backed views.
